-She's still got some fight in her. -What the fuck was all that?

621
43:26.865 --> 43:28.345
You know how fucking childish that was?

622
43:28.425 --> 43:31.945
I'll get my dad to deal with every last one of you.

623
43:32.025 --> 43:34.265
Then you'll see what real power looks like.

624
43:35.145 --> 43:36.705
You're going to pay for this!

625
43:39.545 --> 43:40.625
Hello, Dad?

626
43:40.705 --> 43:42.745
Hello? Pim?

627
43:44.345 --> 43:46.305
Perfect timing, Dad. I was about to…

628
43:46.385 --> 43:48.465
Pim, what trouble have you gotten into?

629
43:49.225 --> 43:50.745
What? Trouble?

630
43:50.825 --> 43:52.665
I haven't done anything. What are you talking about?

631
43:52.745 --> 43:53.585
It wasn't me.

632
43:53.665 --> 43:55.545
Then why are there vehicles lined up outside our house?

633
43:55.625 --> 43:57.505
Vehicles? What vehicles?

634
43:57.585 --> 43:59.785
What did you do? Who did you mess with? Tell me right now.

635
43:59.865 --> 44:00.705
I didn't do anything.

636
44:00.785 --> 44:02.745
Can you hear that? People keep ringing the doorbell.

637
44:02.825 --> 44:05.265
What are you talking about, Dad? I don't understand.

638
44:06.105 --> 44:08.105
Hello? Hello?

639
44:08.185 --> 44:09.025
Pim?

640
44:09.745 --> 44:10.865
Hello?

641
44:28.345 --> 44:32.105
Sure, that whole act was fake.

642
44:34.705 --> 44:36.705
But our families' connections?

643
44:38.305 --> 44:39.585
Those are real.

644
44:49.025 --> 44:50.305
Good luck.

645
45:11.865 --> 45:13.745
Hey. Well…

646
45:13.825 --> 45:15.825
Since we're already here, why don't we do that thing?

647
45:15.905 --> 45:17.265
What thing?

648
45:17.345 --> 45:19.745
-That thing. -Okay.

649
45:25.625 --> 45:27.105
What are you going to do?

650
45:28.625 --> 45:29.625
Stay away from me.

651
45:30.785 --> 45:33.105
Don't come any closer! Go!

652
45:34.145 --> 45:35.505
Don't come any closer!

653
45:36.465 --> 45:38.545
One, two, three.

654
45:49.785 --> 45:51.665
JUNJAI'S REALLY THE NEW #TOXXXXIN MEMBER?

655
45:51.745 --> 45:52.825
I ASKED WI. IT'S CONFIRMED.

656
45:54.705 --> 45:56.225
-WILL IT BE FIVE X'S? -PLOYPIM'S OUT SICK NOW.

657
45:58.745 --> 45:59.865
SHE'S KIND OF CUTE.

658
46:00.785 --> 46:02.185
-NEED DETAILS. -KIND OF SHIPPING THEM…

659
46:02.265 --> 46:03.985
-WHO EVEN IS SHE? -NO IDEA, BUT AIDAO'S GORGEOUS.

660
46:04.065 --> 46:04.945
FAB! THEIR FIFTH X!

661
46:06.425 --> 46:08.505
Cheers!

662
46:10.505 --> 46:13.705
The helicopter rental's all paid for.

663
46:15.585 --> 46:17.105
Goodbye, savings.

664
46:17.185 --> 46:20.025
Come on. It was worth it, right?

665
46:20.105 --> 46:23.225
Absolutely. I'm so freaking relieved.

666
46:28.505 --> 46:32.345
Guys, thanks a lot for going along with the plan.

667
46:32.985 --> 46:34.265
Especially you, Mei.

668
46:34.345 --> 46:35.705
Thanks for swallowing your pride

669
46:35.785 --> 46:38.265
and borrowing a van from your family's dealership.

670
46:38.345 --> 46:40.425
No problem.

671
46:40.505 --> 46:41.905
That's good, you know.

672
46:41.985 --> 46:44.505
At least my dad's tacky business

673
46:44.585 --> 46:48.785
finally came in handy for something other than embarrassing me.

674
46:50.145 --> 46:52.145
NONG MEI'S DAD AUTO OPEN 10:00 to 18:00 IT'S GOTTA BE MEI!

675
46:55.425 --> 46:56.945
Shit, just saying it gives me chills.

676
46:57.025 --> 46:58.625
I'm afraid anyone at school will find out.

677
47:00.745 --> 47:01.585
And Gale,

678
47:02.145 --> 47:05.345
thanks for getting your friends to help.

679
47:05.425 --> 47:06.625
We've got your back.

680
47:06.705 --> 47:10.345
It takes a little more effort, but it beats using your dad's influence.

681
47:10.945 --> 47:11.785
Yeah.

682
47:11.865 --> 47:13.665
So, what do we do now?

683
47:13.745 --> 47:17.265
Especially since we announced Junjai's in Toxxxxin.

684
47:17.345 --> 47:19.065
People are already talking.

685
47:19.625 --> 47:20.665
I don't know.

686
47:21.345 --> 47:25.145
Honestly, we kind of forced her into it.

687
47:25.225 --> 47:27.785
We don't even know if she's okay with it.

688
47:28.385 --> 47:30.665
I've sent her so many messages, but she hasn't replied.

689
47:30.745 --> 47:32.185
How could she?

690
47:33.745 --> 47:34.985
Her phone's still here.

691
47:35.905 --> 47:36.825
Huh?!

692
47:37.425 --> 47:39.105
-How did you end up with it? -Right.

693
47:39.185 --> 47:43.025
It broke that day, so I thought I'd get it fixed for her.

694
47:43.105 --> 47:44.985
There was something else bothering me too.

695
47:45.065 --> 47:46.665
I was going to pull the data and take a look.

696
47:46.745 --> 47:48.105
Are you crazy?

697
47:48.185 --> 47:49.505
What about her privacy?

698
47:49.585 --> 47:53.225
Her phone could be full of cute pictures of her.

699
47:56.345 --> 47:58.465
Well, maybe taking a little look would be fine.

700
47:59.105 --> 48:01.385
Aidao, stop.

701
48:01.465 --> 48:03.665
Get a grip.

702
48:03.745 --> 48:05.665
Speak of the devil.

703
48:06.425 --> 48:07.585
She's coming.

704
48:09.385 --> 48:11.785
Go give it back, then.

705
48:11.865 --> 48:13.185
Hey!

706
48:13.265 --> 48:16.785
Hi, Junjai! Your phone's fixed.

707
48:16.865 --> 48:19.385
-Here. Catch! -Wait! Don't throw it!

708
48:19.985 --> 48:21.025
Damn.

709
48:27.905 --> 48:29.465
Thank you.

710
48:29.545 --> 48:32.625
No problem. Repairs are on us.

711
48:32.705 --> 48:35.945
I meant for everything.

712
48:36.625 --> 48:38.225
Thank you.

713
48:41.585 --> 48:43.945
-She really is adorable, isn't she? -Yeah.

714
48:45.105 --> 48:48.185
Well? What are you going to do?

715
48:48.265 --> 48:49.625
If you let her leave,

716
48:50.225 --> 48:52.305
who knows when you'll see her again?

717
48:56.025 --> 48:58.585
I should get to class.

718
48:58.665 --> 49:00.105
Okay!

719
49:01.065 --> 49:03.505
You might never see her again.

720
49:50.225 --> 49:51.665
That wasn't so hard, now was it?

721
49:58.265 --> 50:00.505
Wait, wait, wait!

722
50:07.025 --> 50:09.705
Did you need something, Aidao?

723
50:10.905 --> 50:14.665
Well… what do you think?

724
50:14.745 --> 50:16.585
I'm here to take you to the club room.

725
50:18.785 --> 50:20.145
Toxxxxin style.

726
50:21.385 --> 50:22.425
Huh?

727
50:22.505 --> 50:24.185
Why are you so confused?

728
50:24.265 --> 50:27.305
I told you. You really are Toxxxxin's fifth member.

729
50:29.105 --> 50:32.185
Don't tell me you forgot.

730
50:32.265 --> 50:33.745
No, I didn't.

731
50:33.825 --> 50:38.185
Or did you think I was joking yesterday?

732
50:38.785 --> 50:40.865
I'm not like that, you know.

733
50:40.945 --> 50:45.425
No, it's just… I mean…

734
50:45.505 --> 50:47.665
I…

735
50:55.825 --> 51:02.345
Do I really get to be this close to you every day?

736
51:16.785 --> 51:17.905
Can we go now?

737
51:26.105 --> 51:28.265
Well, I…

738
51:30.505 --> 51:34.905
Let me put my bag away first.

739
51:36.385 --> 51:37.905
Hey, what are you doing?

740
51:37.985 --> 51:39.825
You're taking forever.

741
51:54.545 --> 51:58.585
Keep this up, and I'll have to kidnap you.

742
52:04.105 --> 52:05.025
Okay.

743
52:08.785 --> 52:09.945
That wasn't so hard, now was it?

744
52:12.825 --> 52:13.865
Come on.

745
52:28.105 --> 52:29.745
And that was how it all began.

746
52:29.825 --> 52:32.345
The story of a little black cat,

747
52:33.225 --> 52:37.305
raised in a cage where even dreaming was forbidden.

748
52:37.385 --> 52:41.145
Yet, her dreams were more beautiful than anyone else's.

749
52:42.305 --> 52:43.745
And then there was me.

750
52:43.825 --> 52:50.465
Back then, I had no idea how exciting the story ahead would be…

751
52:53.345 --> 52:55.505
how much laughter and how many tears it would bring,

752
52:56.665 --> 52:58.905
or how deeply it would warm my heart.

753
53:00.345 --> 53:06.345
Who would've thought our Toxxxxin gang would come this far?

754
53:06.425 --> 53:08.345
It's almost unbelievable.

755
53:16.905 --> 53:17.985
Nails!

756
53:18.065 --> 53:21.345
You guys are nothing like I imagined.

757
53:22.105 --> 53:24.185
You're all so down-to-earth.

758
53:24.265 --> 53:25.425
It feels like a dream.

759
53:25.505 --> 53:27.225
YOU DON'T BELONG IN TOXXXXIN!

760
53:27.305 --> 53:31.105
Not everyone loves and worships Toxxxxin, you know.

761
53:31.625 --> 53:33.905
She won't be able to take staying in Toxxxxin forever.

762
53:34.505 --> 53:37.665
The important thing is learning to love yourself first.

763
53:38.265 --> 53:41.225
Just be yourself. That's the best thing you can do.
